# Third-Party Licenses

The crates listed below are the third-party dependencies of the int2DDS binary
distributions. Most are statically linked into the binaries; procedural macros
among them run only at build time and are listed for completeness. Where a crate
offers a choice of licenses, the first match in the order of `accepted` in
about.toml is the one used. The license text each crate ships is reproduced as
is, including its copyright notice; a crate that ships none is represented by
the standard text of its declared license.

